Added `client.block_types` and the `block-types` command, which list the blocks of a Volto site and describe their data from the `@blocks-schema` service of the Volto server, reached through the new `frontend_url` setting. Sites without that service get the documentation of Volto's core blocks instead. The new `markdown` extra converts Markdown and HTML to blocks with `collective.html2blocks`, on Python 3.12 or later. @ericof
